From: Pavel Dubrova <pashadubrova@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 8 Dec 2023 04:38:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fbdev: earlycon: Protect screen_info struct

Protect screen_info struct with CONFIG_EFI be sure
that we do not get a duplicate symbol.

Signed-off-by: Pavel Dubrova <pashadubrova@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/video/fbdev/earlycon.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/video/fbdev/earlycon.c b/drivers/video/fbdev/earlycon.c
index 9d22cb6e9db1..88e0c99eceb5 100644
--- a/drivers/video/fbdev/earlycon.c
+++ b/drivers/video/fbdev/earlycon.c
@@ -21,7 +21,9 @@ static u32 simplefb_x, simplefb_y;
 static u64 fb_base;
 static void *simplefb_fb;
 
+#ifndef CONFIG_EFI
 struct screen_info screen_info;
+#endif
 
 static int __init simplefb_earlycon_remap_fb(void)
 {
